## Bug Location 2 — `server/server.js`, `Pool.release()`

**File:** `server/server.js`  
**Lines:** 218–222  
**Function:** `Pool.release()`

```js
// CURRENT (buggy)
release(obj) {
  if (this.freeList.length < this.maxSize) {
    this.freeList.push(obj);
  }
}
